                    <p class="text-content-secondary text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Choose a unique password that you don't use on other websites. We recommend at least 12 characters with a mix of letters, numbers and symbols.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-primary flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
