                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-content-primary dark:text-white">Enable two-factor authentication</h4>
                    <p class="text-content-secondary text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">Add an extra layer of security to your account by enabling 2FA. This requires a code from your phone each time you log in.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-primary flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                    <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-content-primary dark:text-white">Watch for phishing</h4>
                    <p class="text-content-secondary text-sm mt-2 leading-relaxed">We will never ask for your password via email. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from us, contact our support team directly.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

